# Used by docker/Dockerfile (see scripts/deploy-check.sh).
#
# `node_modules` IS excluded (rebuilt fresh inside the Linux container, where
# `npm install` resolves Linux binaries rather than the macOS/ARM host's).
#
# `lib/` is deliberately NOT excluded, unlike a typical Docker setup: it is
# built once on the host, before `docker build` runs, via
# `npx tsc -b examples/example-machine` (see scripts/deploy-check.sh) — that
# project stays green on its own; the whole workspace's `tsc -b` does not,
# while other agents' packages are mid-flight in this same session (see
# docs/deploy-notes.md). Building only what this example needs, once, on the
# host, and shipping the result in, decouples this image from that
# instability. Revisit once the workspace's own `tsc -b` is reliably green
# from a clean checkout.
**/node_modules
**/.tsbuild
**/*.tsbuildinfo
**/.alchemy
.git
.DS_Store
